## 3. Requirements (FR Matrix)

| ID | Priority | Requirement | Implementation / Verification |
|---|---|---|---|
| **FR-1** | **P0** | Manifest `SMS_RECEIVED` receiver; reassemble multipart PDUs; hand off with `goAsync()` within execution budget. | `com.example.receiver.SmsReceiver` with `Telephony.Sms.Intents.getMessagesFromIntent` |
| **FR-2** | **P0** | Insert into Room outbox in one transaction before any network call; failed insert raises a local alert. | `AppDatabase`, `QueuedSmsDao.insertSms()` transaction |
| **FR-3** | **P0** | Discard non-qualifying SMS immediately: no storage, no logging, zero PII leakage. | `SmsFilter.isWalletReceivedMessage()` |
| **FR-4** | **P0** | Sender allowlist (`bKash`, `NAGAD`, `16216` by default), case-insensitive and trimmed; server dynamic updates (max 10 entries); always reject phone-number senders (10+ digits, `+880`, `880`, `01`). | `SmsFilter.isAllowedSender()` & `isPhoneNumberSender()` |
| **FR-5** | **P0** | Qualify only if SMS has an incoming-money word (`received`, `Cash In`, `credited`, Bengali equivalents), an amount (`Tk` or `৳`), and a transaction token (`TrxID`, `TxnId`, `Txn ID`, `TransactionID` + 4-16 alphanumerics). Exclude OTP, PIN, sent, payment to, cash out, recharge. A reference is never required. | `SmsFilter.isWalletReceivedMessage()`, `DISQUALIFY_KEYWORDS` |
| **FR-6** | **P0** | Extract `ref_hint`: label Ref, Reference, Ref No (any case, optional `:`, `-`, `#`) or Bengali label, then a 6 to 20 character alphanumeric token. Normalise to uppercase without spaces or hyphens; null if absent. Server is authority. | `SmsFilter.extractRefHint()` |
| **FR-7** | **P0** | POST to `/v1/sms/webhook` over TLS 1.2+ with bearer token; oldest first, one request in flight, 10s timeout. | `QueueSyncManager.drainQueue()`, `ApiClient` |
| **FR-8** | **P0** | Exponential backoff with jitter: base 2s, cap 15 min; reset on success or network change. | `QueueSyncManager.calculateBackoffDelay()` |
| **FR-9** | **P0** | `client_msg_id = SHA-256(sender \| body \| received_at \| sim_slot)`; server deduplicates. | `SmsFilter.generateClientMsgId()` |
| **FR-10**| **P0** | Retain until resolved: mark delivered only after 2xx; rows older than 24h become stale, stay visible and keep retrying. | `QueuedSms.status = "STALE"` / `PENDING` |
| **FR-11**| **P0** | Drain the queue immediately on connectivity change. | `ConnectivityObserver`, `NetworkCallback` |
| **FR-12**| **P0** | Pair by QR (manual code fallback) issued from Admin console; single-use code expires in 10 min; response lists wallet per SIM slot; distinct errors for expired, used, invalid, offline. | `PairingScreen.kt`, `PairingRequest`, `PairingResponse` |
| **FR-13**| **P0** | Token in Android KeyStore (AES-256-GCM, non-exportable); dynamic rotation via heartbeat response (`rotate_token`). | `KeystoreSecretManager.kt` |
| **FR-14**| **P0** | On 401 or 403: pause delivery, keep queue, show blocking re-pair screen, trigger local alert notification. | `QueueSyncManager`, `PayGateForwarderService` |
| **FR-15**| **P0** | Block forwarding for a SIM slot with no registered wallet and alert the operator. | `PayGateForwarderService`, `SmsFilter` |
| **FR-16**| **P1** | Unpair with app PIN, or remotely from Admin console. | `SettingsScreen.kt`, remote command `REVOKE_TOKEN` |
| **FR-17**| **P0** | Foreground service (`dataSync`) plus `BootReceiver` for `BOOT_COMPLETED`, `LOCKED_BOOT_COMPLETED`, `MY_PACKAGE_REPLACED`. | `PayGateForwarderService`, `BootReceiver` |
| **FR-18**| **P0** | Setup checklist with live status and Fix button per row: SMS, notifications, battery exemption, OEM auto-start, background data, lock in recents, wallet mapping; rechecked on resume and heartbeat. | `HomeScreen.kt`, `HealthChecklistCard` |
| **FR-19**| **P0** | Mandatory app PIN (4-digit operator PIN) for settings, unpair, and reveal actions. | `AppPreferences.appPin`, `PinAuthDialog` |
| **FR-20**| **P0** | Supports Android Enterprise device-owner (kiosk) mode: app locked, installs blocked, USB debugging off. | `AppPreferences.isKioskModeEnabled` |
| **FR-21**| **P0** | Heartbeat every 120s (server-configurable) plus 15 min WorkManager safety net; server marks device offline after 3 min. | `PayGateForwarderService.startPeriodicHeartbeat()` |
| **FR-22**| **P1** | Home: status per SIM and wallet (bKash, Nagad, Rocket), queue depth, stale count, last payment (masked), Sync now, Send test. | `HomeScreen.kt` |
| **FR-23**| **P1** | Activity log of last 200 items: state, provider, amount, reference, masked TrxID with 10s reveal, Retry now. | `ActivityLogScreen.kt` |
| **FR-24**| **P1** | Local alerts: queue stuck over 10 min, token revoked, permissions lost, low storage (<200MB), clock skew (>5 min), SIM change, sudden rise in no-ref SMS. | `PayGateForwarderService.showLocalAlertNotification()` |
| **FR-25**| **P1** | Consent-gated backfill: allowlisted senders only, last 24h (max 72), `READ_SMS` requested only then, items tagged `source="backfill"`. | `BackfillManager.kt`, `AppPreferences` |
| **FR-26**| **P1** | Detect clock skew, SIM changes, and low storage; report them in heartbeat. | `HeartbeatRequest.clockSkewMs`, `freeStorageMb`, `simState` |
| **FR-27**| **P1** | Remote commands through heartbeat response: `revoke`, `flush`, `update_allowlist`, `force_update`, `maintenance`. | `PayGateForwarderService.sendHeartbeatInternal()` |
| **FR-28**| **P2** | Signed in-app update check; diagnostics export with zero PII. | `SettingsScreen.kt`, Diagnostics JSON export |
| **FR-29**| **P1** | English and Bengali (বাংলা) localization with instant switching. | `values/strings.xml`, `values-bn/strings.xml` |

