| **Reference before TrxID**| `... Ref REF934P923 and TrxID DJC9SZQV0J ...` | Forward; `ref_hint = "REF934P923"` |
| **Hyphenated reference** | `... Ref REF-934P923 ...` | Forward; `ref_hint = "REF934P923"` |
| **No reference** | `You have received Tk 1,200.00 from 01712750278. Fee Tk 0.00. Balance Tk 1,200.00. TrxID DJC9SZQV0J at 12/10/2026 15:24` | Forward; `ref_hint = null` |
| **bKash Cash In** | `Cash In Tk 2,500.00 from 01755650768 successful. Fee Tk 0.00. Balance Tk 2,505.39. TrxID DIS133PE5L at 28/09/2026 21:59.` | Forward; `ref_hint = null` |
| **Nagad received** | `You have received Tk 850.00 from 01811223344. Balance Tk 2,400.00. TrxID 72AB3890 at 12/10/2026` | Forward; `ref_hint = null` |
| **Rocket received** | `Tk 3,100.00 received from 01999887766. TxnId 98214. Rocket Balance Tk 5,000.00` | Forward; `ref_hint = null` |
| **OTP mentioning "Ref"** | `Your OTP is 482913. Ref 7781` | Dropped (OTP keyword disqualified) |
| **Forged sender** | Any wallet text sent from `01712345678` or `+88017...` | Dropped by FR-4 (11-digit phone number) |

