## 7. Gate UI Design System

Built on Material 3 with fixed Gate UI design tokens:
- **Background:** `#FAFAF9` (Light) / `#0B0B0E` (Dark)
- **Surfaces:** `#FFFFFF` / `#F4F4F2` (Surface-2) (Light) · `#141418` / `#1C1C22` (Dark)
- **Borders:** `#E7E7E3` (Light) / `#2A2A31` (Dark) hairline borders
- **Accent:** `#5B5BF0` (Light) / `#8B8BFF` (Dark)
- **Status Indicators:** Success (`#12B76A`), Warning (`#F79009`), Error (`#F04438`)
- **Typography:** Display 32sp, H1 24sp, H2 20sp, Body 16sp, Caption 12sp; Monospace font for TrxIDs, reference tokens, and hashes.
